cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below. The DOI here resolves to all versions and always points at the most recent; each GitHub release is also archived under its own DOI, listed on that Zenodo page — cite the release you actually used, which the viewer reports under Cite."
type: software
title: "Protein Structure Viewer"
abstract: >-
  A single-file, browser-based viewer for comparing, annotating and publishing predicted and
  experimental protein structures: AlphaFold confidence (pLDDT, PAE, ipTM), synchronized
  multi-view comparison, Cα superposition with deviation colouring, PAE-derived and named domains,
  residue-property colour schemes, figure annotation, publication-quality PNG, SVG and TIFF export
  at stated print size and resolution, and self-contained interactive reports for reviewers.
  All processing happens in the browser; local files are never uploaded.
